# Independent review of the integrated Sketch collector

The current production 17 synthetic collector checks passed once, with zero failures, skips or cancellations. This review executed only `tests/sketch-collector.test.mjs` from the production Studio product, using an independent Node subprocess wrapper. It did not execute the geometry collector, its 28 geometry tests, bootstrap downloads, original Excalidraw helpers, installation or publication. Generated records were retained in this ignored review directory. Production sources, app records, published results and shared metadata were never written by this review.

The test interval was 2026-10-12T21:06:47.778Z–21:06:50.066Z on Windows Node v24.16.0 (`C:/Program Files/nodejs/node.exe`, SHA-256 `b3094d0b49f9ad602262a9921551737bb97637c05dd357a06ae98188d7290aa3`). The independent run receipt is `results/run-validation.json`, SHA-256 `4c21f5715535557f652265c57c0e7fd295bb0bbadc225940f1a52910e1366769`. Raw TAP stdout, empty stderr and all 14 recorded synthetic child results are retained under `results/`.

